---
# Offshore node that both fronts chains and egresses on them.
ansible_host: 203.0.113.13

# Names angie terminates TLS for, and that the certificate covers. The first is
# this node's primary: chains and subscription links address it by that name.
#
# The apex lives on exactly one node. Certificates are issued over http-01, and
# that challenge is answered by whichever node the name resolves to — so a name
# pointing at several nodes would validate on one of them at random. See the
# acme role.
#
# Read across plays through hostvars, so it belongs in the inventory rather
# than in a role's defaults.
vpn_domains:
  - v3.example.com
  - example.com
